{
  "info": {
    "name": "Distributed Flask App - API Testing",
    "_postman_id": "distributed-flask-app-2026",
    "description": "Collection untuk testing Distributed Flask App dengan berbagai consistency modes.\n\n📌 CONSISTENCY MODES:\n\n1️⃣ STRONG CONSISTENCY (Default)\n- Write ke QUORUM (2/3 nodes)\n- Semua node PASTI konsisten\n- Lebih lambat tapi data akurat\n- Set: CONSISTENCY_MODE=strong\n\n2️⃣ WEAK CONSISTENCY\n- Write HANYA ke primary node (node1)\n- Node lain TIDAK diupdate\n- Super cepat tapi bisa inconsistent\n- Set: CONSISTENCY_MODE=weak\n\n3️⃣ EVENTUAL CONSISTENCY\n- Write ke primary dulu (fast response)\n- Replikasi async (delay 3 detik)\n- Eventually semua node sama\n- Set: CONSISTENCY_MODE=eventual\n\n🔧 CARA GANTI MODE:\nSebelum run app, set environment variable:\nexport CONSISTENCY_MODE=strong\nexport REPLICATION_DELAY=3\nexport QUORUM_SIZE=2",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
