    {
      "name": "3. Read Operations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Read from Node1",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/read/node1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["read", "node1"]
            },
            "description": "📖 Simple read dari node1 (tanpa read repair)\n\n⚡ Fast read - langsung return value dari node1\n❌ Tidak ada consistency check\n❌ Tidak ada read repair\n\n💡 Gunakan untuk:\n- Quick read saat butuh speed\n- Tidak peduli dengan slight inconsistency\n\n⚠️ PERHATIAN:\n- Di WEAK mode: node1 always up-to-date\n- Di EVENTUAL mode: bisa outdated jika baru saja write (tunggu 3 detik)\n- Di STRONG mode: selalu konsisten\n\n🔍 Response fields:\n- value: nilai yang disimpan\n- vector_clock: version tracking\n- timestamp: kapan terakhir diupdate\n- status: healthy/unhealthy"
          },
          "response": []
