        {
          "name": "Quorum Read from Node1",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/read/node1?quorum=true",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["read", "node1"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "quorum",
                  "value": "true"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "🔍 Quorum read dengan READ REPAIR mechanism\n\n✅ CARA KERJA:\n1. Baca dari 2 nodes (quorum)\n2. Bandingkan values\n3. Jika BEDA → pilih yang terbaru (Last-Write-Wins)\n4. Update node yang ketinggalan (READ REPAIR)\n5. Return value\n\n💡 KAPAN PAKAI:\n- Butuh consistency guarantee\n- Suspect ada inconsistency\n- Setelah node failure recovery\n- Di EVENTUAL/WEAK mode untuk verify\n\n⚙️ READ REPAIR:\n- Otomatis fix inconsistency\n- Update stale nodes\n- Tracked di metrics.read_repairs\n\n⚡ Trade-off:\n- Lebih lambat dari simple read (~2x latency)\n- Tapi lebih reliable & self-healing\n\n📊 Check metrics setelah quorum read:\ncurl {{base_url}}/metrics\nLihat field 'read_repairs' untuk count"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Quorum Read from Node2",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/read/node2?quorum=true",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["read", "node2"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "quorum",
                  "value": "true"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Quorum read dari node2"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
