            "description": "🔄 Toggle status node2 (healthy ↔️ unhealthy)\n\n💡 SIMULASI NODE FAILURE:\n- Call pertama: matikan node2 (unhealthy)\n- Call kedua: hidupkan lagi (healthy)\n\n🧪 TEST SCENARIOS:\n\n1️⃣ Test Fault Tolerance:\n   - Matikan 1 node\n   - Write masih sukses? (quorum = 2/3)\n   - Check health status\n\n2️⃣ Test Quorum:\n   - Matikan 2 nodes\n   - Write akan GAGAL (quorum tidak tercapai)\n\n3️⃣ Test Recovery:\n   - Matikan node → write\n   - Hidupkan lagi\n   - Verify data consistency\n\n⚠️ IMPACT PER MODE:\n\n🔵 STRONG: Masih bisa write selama 2 nodes healthy\n🟡 WEAK: Gagal jika node1 (primary) down\n🟢 EVENTUAL: Replikasi skip node yang down\n\n✅ Response:\n- previous_status: status sebelumnya\n- new_status: status baru\n\n🔍 Cek dampaknya:\nGET /health → lihat quorum_met\nGET /nodes → lihat status semua node"
          },
          "response": []
        },
